@CmdbAssistant_HostAddress = http://localhost:5072

### Check API health
GET {{CmdbAssistant_HostAddress}}/healthz
Accept: application/json

###

### Ask about failure impact
POST {{CmdbAssistant_HostAddress}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"question": "If orders-db-primary fails, which services are affected?"
}

### Ask about a complete service stack
POST {{CmdbAssistant_HostAddress}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"question": "What is the full technology stack beneath Order Fulfillment?"
}

### Ask about ownership
POST {{CmdbAssistant_HostAddress}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"question": "How does each business service trace through to its application and owner?"
}

### View proactive infrastructure insights
GET {{CmdbAssistant_HostAddress}}/api/insights
Accept: application/json

### View loaded graph counts
GET {{CmdbAssistant_HostAddress}}/api/graph/summary
Accept: application/json

### OpenAPI document in Development
GET {{CmdbAssistant_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json
